  "note": "The single authority for generation models (plan D27, DM-1). `id`, `provider`, `provider_model`, `kind`, `capabilities`, limits and `request_shape` drive the adapters and validators; `label`, `friendlyLabel`, `help` and `icon` are the presentation layer and may be reworded freely. Costs are in pence and are estimates the adult can see; verify against the provider's price list when enabling a model. Adding a model is an edit here plus, at most, one adapter. Video models carry a `tier` (low, medium, high): the child picks a cost level, never a model.",
